message: "If you use FedDrift, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "FedDrift: vintage-labeled distribution shift in U.S. federal economic and freight statistics"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-04"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23143665"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TosinClement/feddrift"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Clement"
    given-names: "Tosin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-2055-5113"
    email: "clementtosin92@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher"
abstract: "Revision events for 17 U.S. federal economic and freight series (Census MARTS, MRTS, M3, MTIS; BLS CPI, PPI; BTS TSI) built from 6312 ALFRED real-time vintages, with revision footprints, cause labels verified by the author against cited agency documents, an agency-sourced anchor vintage, hash-verified reconstruction manifests, and two benchmark tasks."
keywords:
  - real-time data
  - data revisions
  - distribution shift
  - official statistics
  - ALFRED
  - benchmark
